When you polymorph, your character must make a saving throw that is based
on Constitution.  (No, I don't know the formula.)  If you fail it, you
"shudder," and lose hit points, sometimes enough to kill you.  If you make
it, you are polymorphed.

As you read the scroll, it disappears. -more-
